{
    "title": "ICE2U",
    "description": "The ICE2U app will allow you to purchase ice within the app and earn reward points towards free ice at all participating Twice the Ice and Partner locations.  Load your app with funds, visit a participating machine and vend your bag of Ice right from the app without ever having to touch the machine.  For every 10 bags purchased you will get 1 bag for free.  Find the nearest Twice The Ice vending machine from your current location and get driving directions right from the app.  Twice the Ice locations provide fresh bagged ice 24/7 and fresh filtered or purified water a participating locations.  A Healthy lifestyle starts with fresh products.  Twice the Ice ensures that you are receiving fresh, high quality ice & water any time of day.  Now you can use a convenient App to find the TTI in your community so you can taste the difference.\r\n\r\n* Not all Twice the Ice machines participate in the ICE2U program.  Please make sure that you check the locations tab in the app before visiting a machine.",
